(7146231, 1095728, 96751, '<td valign="top">Always sad to see these. I like bits of this image very much (the sky, the line of bare trees in the bg, the silhouettes of the two subjects), but somehow the whole thing doesn''t hang together for me. Perhaps it''s the composition (I tried cutting out the far right side at the shortest tree) and that seems to help</td>', 'Always sad to see these. I like bits of this image very much (the sky, the line of bare trees in the bg, the silhouettes of the two subjects), but somehow the whole thing doesn''t hang together for me. Perhaps it''s the composition (I tried cutting out the far right side at the shortest tree) and that seems to help', '2013-12-23 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146233, 1095926, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful idea. For me there are too many competing textures</td>', 'A wonderful idea. For me there are too many competing textures', '2013-12-23 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
