(7147509, 1095792, 144271, '<td valign="top">That tree doesn''t look like it will make it.  Beautiful scene I love the black and white</td>', 'That tree doesn''t look like it will make it.  Beautiful scene I love the black and white', '2013-12-26 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147510, 1095728, 144271, '<td valign="top">So sad.  The sky really enhances this view.  I am not sure if it is smoke or clouds but it looks like the after effects</td>', 'So sad.  The sky really enhances this view.  I am not sure if it is smoke or clouds but it looks like the after effects', '2013-12-26 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147511, 1095580, 144271, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2013-12-26 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147512, 1095423, 144271, '<td valign="top">Love this one.</td>', 'Love this one.', '2013-12-26 10:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147513, 1095929, 144271, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very effective</td>', 'Very simple but very effective', '2013-12-26 10:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147514, 1095916, 144271, '<td valign="top">Great background blur to bring out this poor soul</td>', 'Great background blur to bring out this poor soul', '2013-12-26 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147564, 1095919, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the loving attention paid to the declining berry, still glowing with life.  Also the mantis-like vegetation.</td>', 'I like the loving attention paid to the declining berry, still glowing with life.  Also the mantis-like vegetation.', '2013-12-26 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147574, 1095951, 173350, '<td valign="top">I like the way you captured a feeling in this image.</td>', 'I like the way you captured a feeling in this image.', '2013-12-26 12:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147575, 1095606, 173350, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and angles.</td>', 'Interesting textures and angles.', '2013-12-26 12:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147576, 1095895, 173350, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and contrast</td>', 'Nice use of color and contrast', '2013-12-26 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147577, 1095550, 173350, '<td valign="top">I like the brokah and repetition of pattern.</td>', 'I like the brokah and repetition of pattern.', '2013-12-26 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147578, 1095959, 173350, '<td valign="top">I feel it.</td>', 'I feel it.', '2013-12-26 12:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147579, 1095781, 173350, '<td valign="top">I love the humor!</td>', 'I love the humor!', '2013-12-26 12:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147580, 1095595, 173350, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2013-12-26 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147581, 1095729, 173350, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the chuckle.</td>', 'Thanks for the chuckle.', '2013-12-26 12:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147582, 1095701, 173350, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture.</td>', 'Nice color and texture.', '2013-12-26 12:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147618, 1095950, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The composition of diverse shapes and textures is nicely balanced.  I believe that the patience and vision to appreciate such scenes can bring happiness of a sort.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The composition of diverse shapes and textures is nicely balanced.  I believe that the patience and vision to appreciate such scenes can bring happiness of a sort.', '2013-12-26 14:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147620, 1095947, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quite an assemblage of aged objects with dead flora ably keeping pace.  I like the genteel decay.  The central sunflower could have been more aptly placed, in<br/>my opinion.</td>', 'Quite an assemblage of aged objects with dead flora ably keeping pace.  I like the genteel decay.  The central sunflower could have been more aptly placed, inmy opinion.', '2013-12-26 15:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147623, 1095781, 170018, '<td valign="top">That reminded me an old joke about two Jewish men walking at the cemetery. One is saying: "Here lies David, he was a great tailor, true master! When I die, I would like to lie next to him!" Approaching next tomb he exclaims: "Here lies Abraham, amazing watchmaker! When I die, I would like to lie next to him!" Going further he asks his friend:"Moshe, who is the person YOU would like to lie next to?" Moshe replies: "My neighbor Sarah!"<br/>-But she is alive!?!<br/>-There you go!<br/> <br/>Pardon my translation, which may have mistakes, but I hope I passed the general idea.<br/>Which, I guess, is the same in your photo! :-) Which I like a lot, with all those different amazing expressions!</td>', 'That reminded me an old joke about two Jewish men walking at the cemetery. One is saying: "Here lies David, he was a great tailor, true master! When I die, I would like to lie next to him!" Approaching next tomb he exclaims: "Here lies Abraham, amazing watchmaker! When I die, I would like to lie next to him!" Going further he asks his friend:"Moshe, who is the person YOU would like to lie next to?" Moshe replies: "My neighbor Sarah!"-But she is alive!?!-There you go! Pardon my translation, which may have mistakes, but I hope I passed the general idea.Which, I guess, is the same in your photo! :-) Which I like a lot, with all those different amazing expressions!', '2013-12-26 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147638, 1095958, 170018, '<td valign="top">That''s a great contrast to the summer version of this place! One can feel how quiet it is!</td>', 'That''s a great contrast to the summer version of this place! One can feel how quiet it is!', '2013-12-26 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147639, 1095885, 170018, '<td valign="top">Fascinating pattern!</td>', 'Fascinating pattern!', '2013-12-26 15:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147642, 1095917, 173844, '<td valign="top">This fading flower has the feel of stained glass, highlighting its beauty.</td>', 'This fading flower has the feel of stained glass, highlighting its beauty.', '2013-12-26 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147647, 1095825, 170018, '<td valign="top">That should the photo from Southern Hemisphere. <br/>Gorgeous colors!</td>', 'That should the photo from Southern Hemisphere. Gorgeous colors!', '2013-12-26 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147649, 1095836, 173844, '<td valign="top">From the left, a geisha, seahorse and bird with nesting material.  Thank you for this curious juxtaposition.  I enjoy pictures that invite the imagination in.</td>', 'From the left, a geisha, seahorse and bird with nesting material.  Thank you for this curious juxtaposition.  I enjoy pictures that invite the imagination in.', '2013-12-26 15:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147652, 1095541, 173844, '<td valign="top">These fading starlets (whereas actors seem to mature) are cheerfully performing before their audience of leaves.  It makes me smile.</td>', 'These fading starlets (whereas actors seem to mature) are cheerfully performing before their audience of leaves.  It makes me smile.', '2013-12-26 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147659, 1095948, 173844, '<td valign="top">Read the title and immediately felt the roiling emotion. Nice achievement of imagination.  Does the greenery imply that life goes on, or regeneration after death?</td>', 'Read the title and immediately felt the roiling emotion. Nice achievement of imagination.  Does the greenery imply that life goes on, or regeneration after death?', '2013-12-26 16:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147787, 1095928, 109227, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful softness of this.  Looks like a watercolor.</td>', 'I love the beautiful softness of this.  Looks like a watercolor.', '2013-12-26 19:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147788, 1095550, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh</td>', 'Nice bokeh', '2013-12-26 19:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147858, 1095947, 150277, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like the lighting and the hint of yellow.</td>', 'Pretty.  I like the lighting and the hint of yellow.', '2013-12-26 22:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147859, 1095928, 150277, '<td valign="top">I found this just lovely.  A bit ethereal.</td>', 'I found this just lovely.  A bit ethereal.', '2013-12-26 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147860, 1095958, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the building in the background.  It makes the shot so interesting.</td>', 'I love the building in the background.  It makes the shot so interesting.', '2013-12-26 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147861, 1095957, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the color and composition.  Neat photo.</td>', 'I like the color and composition.  Neat photo.', '2013-12-26 22:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147862, 1095959, 150277, '<td valign="top">Stunning.</td>', 'Stunning.', '2013-12-26 22:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147863, 1095912, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I love the black and white.</td>', 'Very pretty, I love the black and white.', '2013-12-26 22:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147864, 1095916, 150277, '<td valign="top">The golden background really highlights the remains of the flower.  Beautiful.</td>', 'The golden background really highlights the remains of the flower.  Beautiful.', '2013-12-26 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147865, 1095960, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2013-12-26 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147866, 1095817, 150277, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Perfect framing to me.</td>', 'Neat.  Perfect framing to me.', '2013-12-26 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147867, 1095901, 150277, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous blue sky.</td>', 'What a gorgeous blue sky.', '2013-12-26 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147868, 1095827, 150277, '<td valign="top">The golds of the wood and parts of the branches is so pretty, yet the tree is so sad. The one ornament makes the photo for me.</td>', 'The golds of the wood and parts of the branches is so pretty, yet the tree is so sad. The one ornament makes the photo for me.', '2013-12-26 22:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147869, 1095937, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Love this.</td>', 'Wow.  Love this.', '2013-12-26 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147871, 1095792, 150277, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo.</td>', 'Pretty photo.', '2013-12-26 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147872, 1095917, 150277, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, smooth and peaceful.</td>', 'Looks like a painting, smooth and peaceful.', '2013-12-26 22:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147873, 1095423, 150277, '<td valign="top">What a strong photo.  Amazing light.</td>', 'What a strong photo.  Amazing light.', '2013-12-26 22:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147874, 1095420, 150277, '<td valign="top">How creative.  I love the lighting.</td>', 'How creative.  I love the lighting.', '2013-12-26 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147894, 1095797, 173844, '<td valign="top">We cut down living trees to suit our mundane, utilitarian purposes.  So this is more than a case of a pun.  Having been a cabinetmaker, I still struggle with this moral dilemma.</td>', 'We cut down living trees to suit our mundane, utilitarian purposes.  So this is more than a case of a pun.  Having been a cabinetmaker, I still struggle with this moral dilemma.', '2013-12-26 23:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147897, 1095956, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is actually more beguiling than when alive, in my opinion.  The depth of focus feels perfect.  Thank you for opening my eyes to this new found vision.</td>', 'This is actually more beguiling than when alive, in my opinion.  The depth of focus feels perfect.  Thank you for opening my eyes to this new found vision.', '2013-12-26 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7147918, 1095965, 169861, '<td valign="top">Great Photo nice job.</td>', 'Great Photo nice job.', '2013-12-27 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147991, 1095956, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - hydrangeas are as lovely in death as they are in life.</td>', 'Very pretty - hydrangeas are as lovely in death as they are in life.', '2013-12-27 07:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147999, 1095903, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this spare, delicately textured still life, where death yields decor, shadowed by itself.</td>', 'I like this spare, delicately textured still life, where death yields decor, shadowed by itself.', '2013-12-27 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148003, 1095953, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title of this photo perfectly conveys serendipitous, transient tenderness.  Moving and well seen.</td>', 'The title of this photo perfectly conveys serendipitous, transient tenderness.  Moving and well seen.', '2013-12-27 08:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148007, 1095938, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating stage in the transition, moving between realistic and abstract, which is enhanced by the choice of focus.  The lung-like pattern is icing on the cake.</td>', 'Fascinating stage in the transition, moving between realistic and abstract, which is enhanced by the choice of focus.  The lung-like pattern is icing on the cake.', '2013-12-27 08:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148011, 1095606, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to make this iconic silhouette vertical to the slanting sea.  Works for me. Also like the sepia.</td>', 'Interesting choice to make this iconic silhouette vertical to the slanting sea.  Works for me. Also like the sepia.', '2013-12-27 08:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148041, 1095737, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully tousled sunflowers.  The fourth stem is mysteriously absent; do sunflowers double up?</td>', 'Wonderfully tousled sunflowers.  The fourth stem is mysteriously absent; do sunflowers double up?', '2013-12-27 08:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148046, 1095595, 173844, '<td valign="top">Prickly fellow, still so in death.  The pattern of spikes on the head is fascinating as the angle changes.  A worthy subject and consummate study.</td>', 'Prickly fellow, still so in death.  The pattern of spikes on the head is fascinating as the angle changes.  A worthy subject and consummate study.', '2013-12-27 08:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148052, 1095829, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on death.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on death.', '2013-12-27 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148053, 1095942, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image.  It has sort of the feel of a mobile.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image.  It has sort of the feel of a mobile.', '2013-12-27 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148056, 1095934, 173844, '<td valign="top">Death is herein implied by regeneration.  Circle.....  Very heartening.</td>', 'Death is herein implied by regeneration.  Circle.....  Very heartening.', '2013-12-27 09:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148058, 1095929, 173844, '<td valign="top">I very much like the feeling of motion brought to this still life by the well-placed, wind-blown dried grass(?).  I also like the vignette.</td>', 'I very much like the feeling of motion brought to this still life by the well-placed, wind-blown dried grass(?).  I also like the vignette.', '2013-12-27 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148061, 1095703, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of the tones of a forest floor.</td>', 'Nice mix of the tones of a forest floor.', '2013-12-27 09:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148090, 1095872, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here we take worthy note of the passing of a single leaf, on its nicely coordinated bier, in loving detail.  An excellent photo.</td>', 'Here we take worthy note of the passing of a single leaf, on its nicely coordinated bier, in loving detail.  An excellent photo.', '2013-12-27 09:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148092, 1095946, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and idea.  I wish her left eye was sharper but I love the tones, her solemn contemplative expression and her natural look which is perfectly in keeping with the simple little crown.  Nice portrait.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and idea.  I wish her left eye was sharper but I love the tones, her solemn contemplative expression and her natural look which is perfectly in keeping with the simple little crown.  Nice portrait.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-12-27 10:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148095, 1095621, 138630, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective and the way the fronds radiate out from the center.  I would have re-toned those green areas in the openings near the top the bluish color - they distract me.  Nicely seen.  Voted earlier; back to comment.</td>', 'I really like the perspective and the way the fronds radiate out from the center.  I would have re-toned those green areas in the openings near the top the bluish color - they distract me.  Nicely seen.  Voted earlier; back to comment.', '2013-12-27 10:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148098, 1095883, 173844, '<td valign="top">If the residue of death can be so handsome, is this consolation?  Maybe.  Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'If the residue of death can be so handsome, is this consolation?  Maybe.  Nice choice of subject.', '2013-12-27 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148101, 1095931, 173844, '<td valign="top">The contours and texture here are nicely offered for exploration.  This is a fun image.</td>', 'The contours and texture here are nicely offered for exploration.  This is a fun image.', '2013-12-27 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148103, 1095927, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement here, beautiful colors and that splash of red at the end (as I read it).  Actually quite pleasing.</td>', 'Nice sense of movement here, beautiful colors and that splash of red at the end (as I read it).  Actually quite pleasing.', '2013-12-27 10:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148104, 1095423, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of infrared. I like the appearance of our galaxy in the sky behind the tree.</td>', 'Interesting choice of infrared. I like the appearance of our galaxy in the sky behind the tree.', '2013-12-27 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148106, 1095898, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is an elegant portrait of milkweed pods.  Those two seem to be smiling at the viewer.  I like the delicate background vegetation.  The lighting brings an immediate sense of winter.</td>', 'This is an elegant portrait of milkweed pods.  Those two seem to be smiling at the viewer.  I like the delicate background vegetation.  The lighting brings an immediate sense of winter.', '2013-12-27 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148110, 1095583, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the almost balletic composition of this vine, lissome still in death.  The lighting is in keeping with the theatrical presentation.</td>', 'I like the almost balletic composition of this vine, lissome still in death.  The lighting is in keeping with the theatrical presentation.', '2013-12-27 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148112, 1095959, 173844, '<td valign="top">Another one of my favorites.  I love the way the sort of silhouette of the dead tree reaches up into the clear sky.  The atmosphere is still and gently moody.  Ah, the west.</td>', 'Another one of my favorites.  I love the way the sort of silhouette of the dead tree reaches up into the clear sky.  The atmosphere is still and gently moody.  Ah, the west.', '2013-12-27 10:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148114, 1095901, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely depiction of rushes.  I sense a poster in its future.</td>', 'Lovely depiction of rushes.  I sense a poster in its future.', '2013-12-27 10:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148115, 1095960, 173844, '<td valign="top">Remarkable.  What a clever vision, so artfully presented.  I really admire this.</td>', 'Remarkable.  What a clever vision, so artfully presented.  I really admire this.', '2013-12-27 10:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148116, 1095420, 173844, '<td valign="top">Spine-tingling.  Very interesting idea nicely realized.</td>', 'Spine-tingling.  Very interesting idea nicely realized.', '2013-12-27 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148118, 1095853, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing, seemingly offhand silhouette.  Plastic flowers?  Okay.  I very much like the overall shimmer.</td>', 'A very pleasing, seemingly offhand silhouette.  Plastic flowers?  Okay.  I very much like the overall shimmer.', '2013-12-27 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148120, 1095730, 173844, '<td valign="top">This still life has well-chosen objects and a beautiful combination of colors.  The right-hand rose feels awkwardly placed, and the focus is not what it could be.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'This still life has well-chosen objects and a beautiful combination of colors.  The right-hand rose feels awkwardly placed, and the focus is not what it could be.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2013-12-27 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148122, 1095963, 173844, '<td valign="top">Striking photo of a child of the forest.  I like her garland and her direct gaze.</td>', 'Striking photo of a child of the forest.  I like her garland and her direct gaze.', '2013-12-27 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148123, 1095372, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the way the upper leaves turn to each other in a loving manner.  Also the fetal incurving.</td>', 'I like the way the upper leaves turn to each other in a loving manner.  Also the fetal incurving.', '2013-12-27 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148124, 1095739, 173844, '<td valign="top">A challenging image that invites the imagination to peer within.  To me it seems to be an otherworldly egg.</td>', 'A challenging image that invites the imagination to peer within.  To me it seems to be an otherworldly egg.', '2013-12-27 11:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148125, 1095792, 173844, '<td valign="top">So this is what a tree''s funeral looks like. I like the sense of melancholy here, and the graininess of the sky.</td>', 'So this is what a tree''s funeral looks like. I like the sense of melancholy here, and the graininess of the sky.', '2013-12-27 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148126, 1095895, 173844, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent, in its descent, of "Do not go gently..."</td>', 'Reminiscent, in its descent, of "Do not go gently..."', '2013-12-27 11:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148127, 1095796, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very attractive study of winter''s details, replete with jewelry.</td>', 'Very attractive study of winter''s details, replete with jewelry.', '2013-12-27 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148129, 1095923, 173844, '<td valign="top">The sky''s reflection (or echo or retransmission) on the tree trunks brings this picture to life.</td>', 'The sky''s reflection (or echo or retransmission) on the tree trunks brings this picture to life.', '2013-12-27 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148130, 1095513, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what the jarring green fabric is doing is this photo.  Maybe it''s a found object, serendipity, just one of those things.</td>', 'I don''t understand what the jarring green fabric is doing is this photo.  Maybe it''s a found object, serendipity, just one of those things.', '2013-12-27 11:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148131, 1095621, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is a fascinating example of nature offering what I couldn''t imagine on my own in a million years.  It reminds me of a sumptuous headdress.  The circle is well-placed in the upper center, I think.</td>', 'This is a fascinating example of nature offering what I couldn''t imagine on my own in a million years.  It reminds me of a sumptuous headdress.  The circle is well-placed in the upper center, I think.', '2013-12-27 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148132, 1095837, 173844, '<td valign="top">The question of what''s below adds macabre tension to this image.</td>', 'The question of what''s below adds macabre tension to this image.', '2013-12-27 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148133, 1095928, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice how the orange coloration seems to be an inner glow.  I wish that the topmost details hadn''t been cut off, which as is looks like someone diving into the rose.</td>', 'Nice how the orange coloration seems to be an inner glow.  I wish that the topmost details hadn''t been cut off, which as is looks like someone diving into the rose.', '2013-12-27 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148135, 1095958, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfectly to my personal taste --- understated appreciation of the seemingly ordinary. I love the way the colors of the building have gone pastel, and how the stems to the left subtly intermingle with the pink.  The only distraction is the white chimney or vent on the roof.  If it''s a snowflake I withdraw the comment.</td>', 'Perfectly to my personal taste --- understated appreciation of the seemingly ordinary. I love the way the colors of the building have gone pastel, and how the stems to the left subtly intermingle with the pink.  The only distraction is the white chimney or vent on the roof.  If it''s a snowflake I withdraw the comment.', '2013-12-27 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148137, 1095926, 173844, '<td valign="top">If this photo has to have meaning and intention, I''d venture that there''s more life to uprooted or torn off vegetation than to mere reflections of life.  Or maybe this plant can be saved, as it doesn''t look dead.  Maybe it''s something else or something more subtle and difficult to pin down.  Maybe it''s just interesting and/or pretty.  One wonders.</td>', 'If this photo has to have meaning and intention, I''d venture that there''s more life to uprooted or torn off vegetation than to mere reflections of life.  Or maybe this plant can be saved, as it doesn''t look dead.  Maybe it''s something else or something more subtle and difficult to pin down.  Maybe it''s just interesting and/or pretty.  One wonders.', '2013-12-27 11:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148138, 1095912, 173844, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a crinoid in the ocean (as seen in google images).  As such, it''s a delightful environmental illusion.</td>', 'Reminds me of a crinoid in the ocean (as seen in google images).  As such, it''s a delightful environmental illusion.', '2013-12-27 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148139, 1095701, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captures the beginning moments of the inevitable fade from life''s brilliance.  Their physical contact is very touching.  No pun intended.</td>', 'Beautifully captures the beginning moments of the inevitable fade from life''s brilliance.  Their physical contact is very touching.  No pun intended.', '2013-12-27 11:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148141, 1095966, 173844, '<td valign="top">This stark photo of an empty seedpod actually feels hopeful; the promise of tomorrow''s lilacs.  I take the narrow depth of focus as a hint.</td>', 'This stark photo of an empty seedpod actually feels hopeful; the promise of tomorrow''s lilacs.  I take the narrow depth of focus as a hint.', '2013-12-27 11:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148142, 1095939, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love her joyful abandon, though I''d rather see her left hand than not.</td>', 'I love her joyful abandon, though I''d rather see her left hand than not.', '2013-12-27 11:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148143, 1095778, 173844, '<td valign="top">You can always count on winter''s lacework.</td>', 'You can always count on winter''s lacework.', '2013-12-27 11:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148144, 1095795, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrayal of winter''s serenity.  It''s just so immediate and, yes, intimate.  The weak sun casts enchanting light.  My favorite of this challenge.<br/>Dead flora too.</td>', 'Beautiful portrayal of winter''s serenity.  It''s just so immediate and, yes, intimate.  The weak sun casts enchanting light.  My favorite of this challenge.Dead flora too.', '2013-12-27 11:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148145, 1095834, 173844, '<td valign="top">I suppose this is a piece of dead wood.  It''s a startling depiction of agony, very powerful and moving.  Or it might be an x-ray of a broken pelvis, in which case agony still pertains.</td>', 'I suppose this is a piece of dead wood.  It''s a startling depiction of agony, very powerful and moving.  Or it might be an x-ray of a broken pelvis, in which case agony still pertains.', '2013-12-27 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148146, 1095906, 173844, '<td valign="top">I find the placement of the brown mass on top to be disconcerting, maybe deliberately so, as is death.  It''s all nicely set off by the surrounding bright greenery and yellowing leaves, as noted in the title.</td>', 'I find the placement of the brown mass on top to be disconcerting, maybe deliberately so, as is death.  It''s all nicely set off by the surrounding bright greenery and yellowing leaves, as noted in the title.', '2013-12-27 11:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148147, 1095946, 173844, '<td valign="top">The fillet of vines -- are dead vines this pliable? -- is confidently supported by this pretty young girl with the thoughtful or sad expression.  Her red hair and brown eyes are very appealing.  I also like how she''s set off against the black field.</td>', 'The fillet of vines -- are dead vines this pliable? -- is confidently supported by this pretty young girl with the thoughtful or sad expression.  Her red hair and brown eyes are very appealing.  I also like how she''s set off against the black field.', '2013-12-27 11:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148148, 1095786, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dying roses don''t easily part with their beauty.  The colors here are still fetching, and the leaves, too, are lovely.</td>', 'Dying roses don''t easily part with their beauty.  The colors here are still fetching, and the leaves, too, are lovely.', '2013-12-27 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148149, 1095729, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very funny, it made me laugh.  I especially appreciate the artfully placed "fig leaf."</td>', 'Very funny, it made me laugh.  I especially appreciate the artfully placed "fig leaf."', '2013-12-27 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148150, 1095921, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-paired and stately in the sunlight, they''ve found dignity in death.  This is an uplifting picture, one of my favorites in the challenge.  Erotic overtones aside.</td>', 'Well-paired and stately in the sunlight, they''ve found dignity in death.  This is an uplifting picture, one of my favorites in the challenge.  Erotic overtones aside.', '2013-12-27 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148151, 1095885, 173844, '<td valign="top">A common scene, but well worth the observation.  Nature''s i ching.</td>', 'A common scene, but well worth the observation.  Nature''s i ching.', '2013-12-27 11:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148152, 1095945, 173844, '<td valign="top">Somewhat garish, death with lipstick, but it certainly engages the senses.  Maybe I''ve missed the point and the intention is to be brash and in your face, challenging death at its own game.  In that case, bravo!</td>', 'Somewhat garish, death with lipstick, but it certainly engages the senses.  Maybe I''ve missed the point and the intention is to be brash and in your face, challenging death at its own game.  In that case, bravo!', '2013-12-27 11:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148154, 1095602, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is reminiscent of an electron microscopic image.  Change the scale and it''s a journalistic image not only of death but devastation.</td>', 'This is reminiscent of an electron microscopic image.  Change the scale and it''s a journalistic image not only of death but devastation.', '2013-12-27 11:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148155, 1095561, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here is a lovely depiction nature''s handsome architecture. Though obviously past their prime, they''re still right smack in the conversation.</td>', 'Here is a lovely depiction nature''s handsome architecture. Though obviously past their prime, they''re still right smack in the conversation.', '2013-12-27 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148156, 1095550, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, enhanced by the bokeh.  A lot of space in the background, but that''s an artistic choice.</td>', 'Lovely image, enhanced by the bokeh.  A lot of space in the background, but that''s an artistic choice.', '2013-12-27 11:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148157, 1095728, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such an undignified demise, fire taking advantage of their noble steadfastness.  Sure, it''s rampant anthropomorphism, but this fine image brings on a sadness, even knowing it''s part of the natural cycle.  Barring arson, that is, which brings on anger.</td>', 'Such an undignified demise, fire taking advantage of their noble steadfastness.  Sure, it''s rampant anthropomorphism, but this fine image brings on a sadness, even knowing it''s part of the natural cycle.  Barring arson, that is, which brings on anger.', '2013-12-27 11:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148158, 1095957, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s an appealing softness to this landscape, well-framed by the foreground tree, enhanced by the fading barn-like structure.  The white house(?) at the back edge of the field is a distraction for me, but perhaps I''m being fussy.</td>', 'There''s an appealing softness to this landscape, well-framed by the foreground tree, enhanced by the fading barn-like structure.  The white house(?) at the back edge of the field is a distraction for me, but perhaps I''m being fussy.', '2013-12-27 11:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148159, 1095838, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a sad air of inevitability here.  I like the lighting, which is consonant with the mood.  I also like the placement of the dish, which seems to be already moving on.</td>', 'There''s a sad air of inevitability here.  I like the lighting, which is consonant with the mood.  I also like the placement of the dish, which seems to be already moving on.', '2013-12-27 11:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148160, 1095573, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice study of a dead flower which has caught some snow in passing.  The white area to the right competes for the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'Nice study of a dead flower which has caught some snow in passing.  The white area to the right competes for the viewer''s attention.', '2013-12-27 11:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148161, 1095825, 173844, '<td valign="top">This photo says, "Look, look what happened."  We''re at the mercy of this beautiful world.  It''s important to face this and here we''re forced to do so.  Admirable presentation.</td>', 'This photo says, "Look, look what happened."  We''re at the mercy of this beautiful world.  It''s important to face this and here we''re forced to do so.  Admirable presentation.', '2013-12-27 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7148162, 1095827, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether to laugh or sigh.  A matter of fact philosophic observation that induces a feeling of wistfulness.</td>', 'I don''t know whether to laugh or sigh.  A matter of fact philosophic observation that induces a feeling of wistfulness.', '2013-12-27 11:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
