(7149333, 1095929, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I wanted to do with my entry, but couldn''t get the image in my head to stay there long enough for me to translate it to real life. Love it.</td>', 'This is exactly what I wanted to do with my entry, but couldn''t get the image in my head to stay there long enough for me to translate it to real life. Love it.', '2013-12-30 02:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
