(7149372, 1095956, 109227, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what happened to my comment during voting (one of those DPC mysteries).  This is my fav of the challenge.  I think dead hydrangeas are more beautiful than fresh ones.  Beautiful comp.</td>', 'I don''t know what happened to my comment during voting (one of those DPC mysteries).  This is my fav of the challenge.  I think dead hydrangeas are more beautiful than fresh ones.  Beautiful comp.', '2013-12-30 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
