(7149374, 1095901, 28427, '<td valign="top">I would not only walk through it; I feel more like laying down in it and admire it for hours.</td>', 'I would not only walk through it; I feel more like laying down in it and admire it for hours.', '2013-12-30 07:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7149375, 1095956, 28427, '<td valign="top">I love dried hydrangeas.  And dead they are even more beautiful then when they flower (in my opinion at least)  Have them in my garden myself I can''t pass a day without looking at them.<br/>Although they need to stay on when dead in order to keep them strong during winter and make them grow even better the next year, I couldn''t resist cutting 2 of them to put in a vase in my office.<br/>Great image showing their beauty Penelope.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love dried hydrangeas.  And dead they are even more beautiful then when they flower (in my opinion at least)  Have them in my garden myself I can''t pass a day without looking at them.Although they need to stay on when dead in order to keep them strong during winter and make them grow even better the next year, I couldn''t resist cutting 2 of them to put in a vase in my office.Great image showing their beauty Penelope. ', '2013-12-30 07:34:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7149377, 1095420, 28427, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would have ended up way higher.  An original and fun take on the challenge.<br/>DOF supporting the overall image.  Fantastic job.</td>', 'I thought this one would have ended up way higher.  An original and fun take on the challenge.DOF supporting the overall image.  Fantastic job.', '2013-12-30 07:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
