(7149813, 1095606, 159103, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and time viewing this photo, I really appreciate it.   This stalk was on a cliff hundreds of feet above the ocean in Italy.   It was completely dead for those of you who were concerned, I think it froze before ever even blooming (it was 40 degrees out mid day when this shot was taken, it had been dead for a long while though).    I liked straightening this stalk up and giving it a last moment of order before it finally snaps and falls off the cliff (which it probably has by now).    Thanks again for commenting.   I spent two weeks in Cinque Terra (amazingly photogenic)  and France and London shooting non stop its nice to be able to share at least this image :-)</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and time viewing this photo, I really appreciate it.   This stalk was on a cliff hundreds of feet above the ocean in Italy.   It was completely dead for those of you who were concerned, I think it froze before ever even blooming (it was 40 degrees out mid day when this shot was taken, it had been dead for a long while though).    I liked straightening this stalk up and giving it a last moment of order before it finally snaps and falls off the cliff (which it probably has by now).    Thanks again for commenting.   I spent two weeks in Cinque Terra (amazingly photogenic)  and France and London shooting non stop its nice to be able to share at least this image :-)', '2013-12-31 11:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
