(7156981, 1095794, 173350, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the feedback and encouragement. I too wish this shot had better focus and that I could have framed it a little differently so that the crinkle of the leaf (resembling a butterfly wing) was more evident. But that''s the wonderful thing I''ve discovered in my short time in this group. Already, I''m a little more aware of such things as I''m composing the shot. I''m definitely benefiting from the challenge!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the feedback and encouragement. I too wish this shot had better focus and that I could have framed it a little differently so that the crinkle of the leaf (resembling a butterfly wing) was more evident. But that''s the wonderful thing I''ve discovered in my short time in this group. Already, I''m a little more aware of such things as I''m composing the shot. I''m definitely benefiting from the challenge!', '2014-01-13 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
